Fraction implementation:

```java
public record Fraction(BigInteger numerator, BigInteger denominator) {
    public Fraction {
        if (denominator.signum() == 0) throw new ArithmeticException("zero denominator");
        if (denominator.signum() < 0) { numerator = numerator.negate(); denominator = denominator.negate(); }
        BigInteger gcd = numerator.gcd(denominator);
        numerator = numerator.divide(gcd);
        denominator = denominator.divide(gcd);
    }
    static Fraction of(BigInteger num, BigInteger den) { return new Fraction(num, den); }
    Fraction add(Fraction o) {
        BigInteger num = numerator.multiply(o.denominator).add(o.numerator.multiply(denominator));
        BigInteger den = denominator.multiply(o.denominator);
        return new Fraction(num, den);
    }
}
```

